message: "If you use this reference library, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "IUT Lean Reference Library"
abstract: >-
  An English, source-audited Lean 4 reference for a bounded finite-symmetry
  layer of Inter-universal Teichmuller Theory I, with theorem-by-theorem
  exposition, adversarial examples, an algebraic poly-morphism prototype,
  machine-readable provenance and independent verification gates.
type: software
